<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian army has conducted air strikes that killed senior Gulf Clan leader and seven others, while a separate strike killed another Gulf Clan leader, reflecting intensified targeting of the criminal gang. Cocaine-linked militias are now using Ukraine-style drones against security forces, and the ELN has announced plans to target corporate media, coinciding with a surge in threats against journalists after a grenade blast outside a TV network. Recruitment for minor armed groups has risen sharply as terrorism cases quadruple under President De la Espriella, and ICE officers with histories of racism have been implicated in the killing of a Colombian migrant. The conflict remains low-intensity with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1MZGNnQ3BCTkhTdjUtTWxTWXh6Z3A3ekZSZ19jX1MzSWhVcVEtNmpWV3J3bThLNXhrNGJoa1hTQXBJYmVfWHRpQmtBbjdKTmhTN3VHM0NKUjJnSVpnSHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPTUZsRWhYbFRFNUY1SFYya3hLb2w3bHRjck5UVmRoMGprQU9JR3BCMjVyWW55N2VyUzJ6M1hOLUVaMll5S0FQTmJqcHZZSm5sNXdNVk1yYWo5Tm5QY1hKUzNuSzJvcjk5UlJmNWduRjI2cXdaUE1VSVRtdU5ldFJ5ZVU0aEJzM2JDRXUwdlJ5X0h4S1NTZzJ1eGxUMW5qSTFzY3FYT0t2S0tlM05zVUNFTzI1cnA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQc3Vmd3FsUjZLaTcwQlpjNDlteWdTT0NUeF8zelZVWm40elpkSkJSbVcxUk1JVWp6RzZBdTY1UDY5T1k5c1BHeFhiVzhCLUwwYWxIUHc4cUJXUTZFSWRaa1hkOFdNLTJ1R1JQbFB5V1pSbzJEQXhQb25yQnVlcTlDa1hNQjZsU1JtdzlndV9jSW91S1hzeHEwcm14ZDZvRS1VQld3cThPaDVBREl5U3h1NkdMbmJINXVSY0o4YlBaWEpQd3VYVkEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOQ3V2TWVnU01mWUhOR1AzeXduVm9qRFpzZ3UySzZrYVlhazc4c2RacTRfME9mTHhLMDQ0UXlFbDRLejFfZHU3T